Subject: [PATCH v2 24/30] PCI/tegra: Remove redundant tegra_pcie_scan_bus()
Date: Wed, 21 Jan 2015 08:30:19 +0800
Message-ID: <1421800225-26230-25-git-send-email-wangyijing@huawei.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.1
